    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνηχ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sound together</i> or <i>in accord</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χαλκεῖα καὶ τὰ κέρατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Aud.</u>
					801b9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>CG</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς σαλπικτὰς ς. κελεύσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					51.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ring with, echo to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς συνηχεῖν αὐτοῖς τὴν ἀγοράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Char.</u>
					6.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.29.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.153
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεις κελάδοις -εῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidon.
					10
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> trans., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκες -ηχοῦσι κωκυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					3.7.26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
